  "description": "Hand-curated effects library shared by Uncraft, Restyle, and Canvas. Six categories (fill, reveal, surface, background, interaction, layout) covering ~90% of beautiful-site primitives. Curated from Aceternity UI, Magic UI, ReactBits, motion-primitives, codrops, Framer Motion examples.",
